{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_entrega_readme_papeis_sem_identidade", "label": "Equipe informada com nomes, telefones e responsabilidades", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/entrega/README.md", "source_location": "L48", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "description": "Pap\u00e9is A/B/C est\u00e3o preenchidos com nomes e telefones fornecidos pela equipe: Caio Augusto de Paiva Teixeira, Davi Mon\u00e7\u00e3o Fernades e Luis Henrique Poubel Buettel. Responsabilidades constam da tabela; n\u00e3o se inferem identidades de branches ou commits.", "_origin": "semantic"}, {"id": "docs_entrega_readme_atendimento_parcial_exigencias", "label": "Atendimento documentado e pend\u00eancias de entrega", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/entrega/README.md", "source_location": "L32", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "description": "H\u00e1 n\u00facleo determin\u00edstico, consulta web em localhost, API real e E2E, processo, arquitetura e regras. Persistem licen\u00e7a, pacote final, material visual e ensaio humano; editor n\u00e3o est\u00e1 conclu\u00eddo.", "_origin": "semantic"}, {"id": "secao5_protecao_paralelo", "label": "Interface preservou API, engine, kb, contratos e vers\u00f5es imut\u00e1veis", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/entrega/README.md", "source_location": "L5", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "description": "A integra\u00e7\u00e3o da interface preservou API, motor, kb, contratos e vers\u00f5es imut\u00e1veis; n\u00e3o h\u00e1 alega\u00e7\u00e3o de altera\u00e7\u00e3o dessas camadas neste bloco documental.", "_origin": "semantic"}, {"id": "docs_entrega_readme_evidencia_testes", "label": "Evid\u00eancia registrada: 1066 Python, 170 subtestes, 39 interface e 8 E2E", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/entrega/README.md", "source_location": "L30", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "description": "O \u00edndice registra 1066 testes Python aprovados, 1 ignorado e 170 subtestes; 132 unittest j\u00e1 est\u00e3o no pytest e n\u00e3o se somam. Registra 39 testes de interface e 8 cen\u00e1rios E2E. H\u00e1 34 casos sint\u00e9ticos com zero falhas; contagens distintas de valida\u00e7\u00e3o cl\u00ednica. S\u00e3o os n\u00fameros desta fonte, sem importar contagens de web/QUALIDADE.md.", "_origin": "semantic"}, {"id": "docs_entrega_readme_cronograma_entrega", "label": "Prazos oficiais: envio 22/10/2026 20h e apresenta\u00e7\u00e3o 23/10/2026 09h", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/entrega/README.md", "source_location": "L64", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "description": "Envio oficial em 22/10/2026 \u00e0s 20h e apresenta\u00e7\u00e3o em 23/10/2026 \u00e0s 09h. Alvo interno de 18h30 \u00e9 decis\u00e3o da equipe; dura\u00e7\u00e3o, anexos e infraestrutura exigem confirma\u00e7\u00e3o.", "_origin": "semantic"}, {"id": "docs_entrega_readme_indice_checkpoint", "label": "\u00cdndice da Se\u00e7\u00e3o 5 e consulta web; checkpoints hist\u00f3ricos distinguidos", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/entrega/README.md", "source_location": "L3", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "description": "\u00cdndice do estado integrado codex-davi com v0002; 898512c e f46cd6e s\u00e3o checkpoints hist\u00f3ricos. Encaminha documentos 01 a 06 e mant\u00e9m o contexto dos registros de processo.", "_origin": "semantic"}, {"id": "docs_entrega_readme_base_ativa_v0002", "label": "Base ativa v0002 e vers\u00f5es imut\u00e1veis preservadas", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/entrega/README.md", "source_location": "L5", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "description": "O estado atual usa base v0002, 34 casos sint\u00e9ticos, React, FastAPI, SQLite e scripts localhost.", "_origin": "semanti